{"id":"n24534-1-7","stage":3,"title":"붐비다 · 拥挤","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24534-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 백화점에 사람 많아?","zh":"今天百货公司人多吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"백화점에","meaning":"百货商店","explanation":"백화점：百货商店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"백화점","audio":"/audio/655eab9f02534cf0ba14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26844","senseId":"1","lemma":"백화점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"백화점에","audio":"/audio/f90ac17eeb93ee01af59.mp3"}},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}},{"text":"많아?","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아","audio":"/audio/cddc8e9fac3b225d8a31.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"655eab9f02534cf0","term":"백화점","zh":"百货商店","audio":"/audio/655eab9f02534cf0ba14.mp3","entryId":"26844","definition":"在一个建筑内按照种类分区摆放和销售各种商品的大商店。","pronunciation":["배콰점"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/88e285461134afa9c267.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24534-1-7-2","ko":"응, 명절 준비 때문에 많은 사람들로 붐비더라.","zh":"嗯，因为要准备节日，人特别多，非常拥挤。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"명절","meaning":"节日","explanation":"명절：节日","readings":[{"term":"명절","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55441","senseId":"1","lemma":"명절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명절","audio":"/audio/7626dbdf4beacffb4c81.mp3"}},{"text":"준비","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비：准备","readings":[{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86434","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}},{"text":"때문에","meaning":"因为，由于","explanation":"때문：因为，由于；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"때문","audio":"/audio/e7ce9cf0ec012e05cb2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64555","senseId":"1","lemma":"때문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때문에","audio":"/audio/870904a840bc33218066.mp3"}},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은","audio":"/audio/dac1aa733d550e544bce.mp3"}},{"text":"사람들로","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因